        "content": "- Use Cases: This dashboard shows the basic project management metrics from JetBrains YouTrack: throughput, lead time, and issue activity.\n- Data Source Required: YouTrack. The plugin collects issues, comments, changelogs (activity feed), tags, accounts and workflow states; each YouTrack project appears as a board.\n- Custom Fields: YouTrack's Type/State/Priority/Assignee are custom fields whose names vary by instance. Field names and type/status mappings are configured per scope config; unmapped statuses fall back to YouTrack's `isResolved` flag (resolved \u2192 DONE, unresolved \u2192 TODO).\n- Kanban projects: set the scope config's State Field to `Stage` for the standard Kanban template. Its issues may have no Type field; select `(no type)` in Issue Type to include them. The transitions chart uses each project's configured State Field.\n- Not collected in v1 (so no panels here): sprints, worklogs/time tracking, epics and issue links.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
